  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "子 agent 怎么被创建",
      "items": [
        "spawn_agent 走 AgentControl::spawn → spawn_agent_internal；codex_delegate.rs 只服务 Review 任务，不是这条路径",
        "进程内新 Session + 自己的 SessionIo，事件由 tokio 任务桥接",
        "三道闸：深度上限、并发上限 reserve_spawn_slot、委派前 approval_policy 必须是 never"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "身份与通信",
      "items": [
        "SessionSource::SubAgent(ThreadSpawn{ parent_thread_id, depth, agent_path, agent_nickname, agent_role })",
        "每个 agent 一个邮箱（InterAgentCommunication），另有按会话树隔离的消息板",
        "V2 工具族：spawn_agent / send_message / followup_task / wait_agent / interrupt_agent / list_agents"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "结果怎么回来",
      "items": [
        "wait_agent 订阅状态到终态，拿 AgentStatus::Completed(last_agent_message)",
        "中间工具流量留在子会话，父级只多一条字符串",
        "send_message 是 QueueOnly（只排队不打断），followup_task 才触发新回合"
      ]
    }
  ]
